            <text x="37.8" y="90.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="50.0" fill="#002B64" textLength="839.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">Sales Distribution (Channel) Options</text>
            <text x="210.8" y="150.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="20.8" fill="#9FC5E8" textLength="169.8" lengthAdjust="spacing">Commission Only</text>
            <text x="213.8" y="175.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="20.8" fill="#9FC5E8" textLength="163.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">(tied) Sales Team</text>
            <text x="564.0" y="150.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="20.8" fill="#9FC5E8" textLength="132.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">Salaried (tied)</text>
            <text x="575.8" y="175.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="20.8" fill="#9FC5E8" textLength="109.2" lengthAdjust="spacing">Sales Team</text>
            <text x="867.2" y="150.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="20.8" fill="#9FC5E8" textLength="195.6" lengthAdjust="spacing">Licensed Distributor</text>
            <text x="891.6" y="175.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="20.8" fill="#9FC5E8" textLength="147.0" lengthAdjust="spacing">(Independents)</text>
            <text x="1225.6" y="150.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="20.8" fill="#9FC5E8" textLength="148.2" lengthAdjust="spacing">Formal Alliance</text>
            <text x="1201.8" y="175.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="20.8" fill="#9FC5E8" textLength="195.6" lengthAdjust="spacing">Licensed Distributor</text>
            <text x="42.9" y="353.4" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="42.3" lengthAdjust="spacing">Pro&#8217;s</text>
            <text x="142.8" y="265.9" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.8" lengthAdjust="spacing">• You have (some) control over the</text>
            <text x="154.0" y="287.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">sales techniques coached and</text>
            <text x="154.0" y="309.7" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="69.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">applied.</text>
            <text x="142.8" y="331.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Your fixed costs are reduced so</text>
            <text x="154.0" y="353.4" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.6" lengthAdjust="spacing">it&#8217;s possible to run a larger sales</text>
            <text x="154.0" y="375.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="54.6" lengthAdjust="spacing">team,</text>
            <text x="237.7" y="375.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="55.5" lengthAdjust="spacing">giving</text>
            <text x="322.2" y="375.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="37.0" lengthAdjust="spacing">you</text>
            <text x="388.3" y="375.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="68.4" lengthAdjust="spacing">greater</text>
            <text x="154.0" y="397.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="107.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">(potentially)</text>
            <text x="279.0" y="397.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="122.3" lengthAdjust="spacing">market-share</text>
            <text x="418.5" y="397.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="38.2" lengthAdjust="spacing">and</text>
            <text x="154.0" y="419.0" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">your cash flow is easier to</text>
            <text x="154.0" y="440.9" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="75.2" lengthAdjust="spacing">manage.</text>
            <text x="477.4" y="276.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Easier to recruit, much greater</text>
            <text x="488.6" y="298.7" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">influence over minimum activity</text>
            <text x="488.6" y="320.6" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">levels and attendance of training</text>
            <text x="488.6" y="342.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="78.6" lengthAdjust="spacing">sessions.</text>
            <text x="477.4" y="364.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.8" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Easier to make sales team better</text>
            <text x="488.6" y="386.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="290.2" lengthAdjust="spacing">focused on customer experience.</text>
            <text x="477.4" y="408.1" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Sales team members stay with</text>
            <text x="488.6" y="430.0" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="185.6" lengthAdjust="spacing">your company longer</text>
            <text x="812.1" y="265.9" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="305.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Gain exposure to more proficient</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="287.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="277.5" lengthAdjust="spacing">sales people (hopefully) as they</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="309.7" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="249.6" lengthAdjust="spacing">are in their own business by</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="331.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="60.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">choice.</text>
            <text x="812.1" y="353.4" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="284.5" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Not bearing any (direct) cost of</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="375.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="275.0" lengthAdjust="spacing">recruitment or training prior to</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="397.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="202.0" lengthAdjust="spacing">chance to assess them.</text>
            <text x="812.1" y="419.0" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.6" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Provides quicker options to scale</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="440.9" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="71.8" lengthAdjust="spacing">globally.</text>
            <text x="1146.7" y="255.0" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="314.0" lengthAdjust="spacing">• You can have greater influence</text>
            <text x="1157.9" y="276.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">over sales tactics, branding and</text>
            <text x="1157.9" y="298.7" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">the after sales support provided</text>
            <text x="1157.9" y="320.6" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="110.6" lengthAdjust="spacing">to customer.</text>
            <text x="1146.7" y="342.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="87.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Possible</text>
            <text x="1262.4" y="342.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="86.5" lengthAdjust="spacing">exposure</text>
            <text x="1376.6" y="342.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="22.8" lengthAdjust="spacing">to</text>
            <text x="1427.2" y="342.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="33.5" lengthAdjust="spacing">the</text>
            <text x="1157.9" y="364.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="109.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">distributor&#8217;s</text>
            <text x="1285.8" y="364.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="104.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">established</text>
            <text x="1408.7" y="364.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="52.0" lengthAdjust="spacing">client</text>
            <text x="1157.9" y="386.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="46.2" lengthAdjust="spacing">base.</text>
            <text x="1146.7" y="408.1" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Able to conduct &#8216;due diligence&#8217; on</text>
            <text x="1157.9" y="430.0" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">their current abilities and market</text>
            <text x="1157.9" y="451.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="99.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">perception.</text>
            <text x="42.9" y="665.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="46.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">Con&#8217;s</text>
            <text x="142.8" y="588.7" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• You have a reduced &#8216;recruitment</text>
            <text x="154.0" y="610.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.6" lengthAdjust="spacing">pool&#8217; and potential for greater</text>
            <text x="154.0" y="632.4" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="191.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">team member &#8216;churn&#8217;.</text>
            <text x="142.8" y="654.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Possible to inherit a cut-throat</text>
            <text x="154.0" y="676.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="48.4" lengthAdjust="spacing">sales</text>
            <text x="245.5" y="676.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="71.2" lengthAdjust="spacing">culture,</text>
            <text x="359.9" y="676.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="96.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">potentially</text>
            <text x="154.0" y="698.0" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="232.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">damaging your reputation.</text>
            <text x="142.8" y="719.9" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="314.0" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Reduced influence over tactics</text>
            <text x="154.0" y="741.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="185.2" lengthAdjust="spacing">used &amp; activity levels.</text>
            <text x="477.4" y="588.7" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Fixed costs increase, cash flow is</text>
            <text x="488.6" y="610.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">harder to manage and you&#8217;re</text>
            <text x="488.6" y="632.4" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="51.6" lengthAdjust="spacing">more</text>
            <text x="562.9" y="632.4" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="78.8" lengthAdjust="spacing">exposed</text>
            <text x="664.4" y="632.4" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="22.8" lengthAdjust="spacing">to</text>
            <text x="709.8" y="632.4" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="81.5" lengthAdjust="spacing">seasonal</text>
            <text x="488.6" y="654.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="281.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">volatility or economic downturn.</text>
            <text x="477.4" y="676.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Due to fixed costs, you&#8217;re forced</text>
            <text x="488.6" y="698.0" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.6" lengthAdjust="spacing">to run a smaller team leaving you</text>
            <text x="488.6" y="719.9" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="107.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">(potentially)</text>
            <text x="615.6" y="719.9" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="64.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">unable</text>
            <text x="699.6" y="719.9" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="22.8" lengthAdjust="spacing">to</text>
            <text x="741.4" y="719.9" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="49.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">meet</text>
            <text x="488.6" y="741.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="285.5" lengthAdjust="spacing">customer demand in busy times.</text>
            <text x="812.1" y="566.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Harder to track sales activity</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="588.7" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">inputs and therein forecast future</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="610.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="76.5" lengthAdjust="spacing">revenue.</text>
            <text x="812.1" y="632.4" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.8" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Little or no ability to forge direct</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="654.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">customer relations so you risk</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="676.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="186.8" lengthAdjust="spacing">losing future up-sells.</text>
            <text x="812.1" y="698.0" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• You&#8217;re forced to fight for their</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="719.9" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">&#8216;sales share&#8217; as they may be</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="741.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">selling your competitors product</text>
            <text x="823.3" y="763.7" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="40.2" lengthAdjust="spacing">also.</text>
            <text x="1146.7" y="566.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Exposure to stock loss as they sell</text>
            <text x="1157.9" y="588.7" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="302.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">units without making payment.</text>
            <text x="1157.9" y="610.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="42.2" lengthAdjust="spacing">(this</text>
            <text x="1224.4" y="610.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="40.2" lengthAdjust="spacing">also</text>
            <text x="1288.8" y="610.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="67.1" lengthAdjust="spacing">applies</text>
            <text x="1380.1" y="610.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="22.8" lengthAdjust="spacing">to</text>
            <text x="1427.2" y="610.5" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="33.5" lengthAdjust="spacing">the</text>
            <text x="1157.9" y="632.4" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="129.4" lengthAdjust="spacing">independent&#8217;s)</text>
            <text x="1146.7" y="654.3" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Harder to exit the relationship if</text>
            <text x="1157.9" y="676.2" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="204.3" lengthAdjust="spacing">it&#8217;s not working for you.</text>
            <text x="1146.7" y="698.0" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="87.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• Possible</text>
            <text x="1263.5" y="698.0" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="66.4" lengthAdjust="spacing">culture</text>
            <text x="1358.7" y="698.0" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="49.4" lengthAdjust="spacing">clash</text>
            <text x="1437.0" y="698.0" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="23.8" lengthAdjust="spacing">or</text>
            <text x="1157.9" y="719.9" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="223.7" lengthAdjust="spacing">administration confusion.</text>
            <text x="1146.7" y="741.8" font-family="Open Sans, sans-serif" font-size="18.8" fill="#FFFFFF" textLength="313.9" lengthAdjust="spacing">• More time consuming to arrange</text>
